  an area or theme in sustainability. The series aims to deepen our underst
 anding of the topic and inspire us to do more.\n\nJoin us for the Dean’s
  Lecture Series featuring Frontiers in Climate Science\, featuring Scienti
 sts Tiffany Shaw\, Gabriel Vecchi\, and Adam Sobel.\n\nFrontiers in Climat
 e Scie\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://web.cvent.com/event/94b499dd-7c2
 4-49ce-b542-26b07e4b2b98/summary\nLast synced: 2026-11-20 12:59 PST
