 al Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270510T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270510T200000
DTSTAMP:20261120T205912Z
UID:stanford_campus-law-10003602-1809973800-1809979200@law.stanford.edu-20
 27-05-10T18:30:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The legal decisions you make at founding\, from corporate stru
 cture to founder equity\, shape your ability to raise capital\, scale\, an
 d avoid costly problems later. This session covers incorporation strategy
 \, including Delaware and alternative structures\, and how to structure fo
 under equity and vesting to protect the team. You’ll also learn the basi
 cs of corporate governance and the fundraising readiness steps investors e
 xpect before they commit capital.\n\nhttps://law.stanford.edu/event/startu
 p-law\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/startup-la
 w-101-build-your-company-on-a-strong-legal-foundation/\nLast synced: 2026-
 11-20 12:59 PST
