UID:stanford_campus-law-10003603-1810146600-1810152000@law.stanford.edu-20
 27-05-12T18:30:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Your intellectual property may be your most valuable asset\, s
 o you need to secure it before you share it with investors\, customers\, o
 r partners. This session explains how patents\, trademarks\, copyrights\, 
 and trade secrets protect your technology\, brand\, and confidential proce
 sses. It also covers key open-source considerations and practical steps fo
 r protecting core assets before fundraising\, launch\, or a partnership.\n
 \nhttps://law.stanford.edu/event/ip-101-protect-the-innovation-that-makes-
 your-s\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/ip-101-pr
 otect-the-innovation-that-makes-your-startup-valuable/\nLast synced: 2026-
